When the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] team came to [[Sutos Island]] to ask [[Grier]]'s help in defeating the [[Blood Spiral]], he said he could assist them in raiding [[the Professor's castle]] to potentially get information on the Spiral's leader, [[Rassimov]]. Grier and [[Dante Vale|Dante]] agreed that [[Simon Judeau|the Professor]] was no fool and must have been at least partially aware of Rassimov's betrayal of [[the Organization]], and was probably keeping files on him. Upon getting to the castle, [[Wilder]] revealed that he also wanted the files, but to blackmail the Spirals to work for him instead of defeating them. As the team out powered him and [[Hoffman]], [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Den Fears]] retrieved the files from within a hidden safe in the Professor's room. {{Source|An Ally from the Organization}}

After [[Metz]] received the files, the [[Huntik Foundation|Foundation]] was able to work out a battle plan to capture Rassimov given the information contained inside them, part of [[The Eye of the Storm]] mission. The mission was initially successful as the team ambushed Rassimov by the [[Tomb of Tutankhamun]], countering his every move with coordinated attacks, which resulted in him being restrained and taken away in a Huntik Foundation vehicle. However, disaster struck when [[Harrison Fears]] freed Rassimov, who invoked [[Legion]], a [[Legendary Titan]] hidden inside his body. The team managed to escape, but only after severe damage was already done. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}}
